{"id":226,"name":"mantine","speciesId":226,"dex":226,"form":"normal","generation":2,"types":["water","flying"],"stats":{"hp":85,"attack":40,"defense":70,"special-attack":80,"special-defense":140,"speed":70},"abilities":[{"name":"swift-swim","hidden":false},{"name":"water-absorb","hidden":false},{"name":"water-veil","hidden":true}],"height":21,"weight":2200,"baseExp":170,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/226.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/226.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/226.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/226.ogg","genus":"Kite Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon pipa","flavor":[{"version":"gold","text":"As it majestically swims, it doesn't care if REMORAID attach to it for scavenging its leftovers."},{"version":"silver","text":"Swimming freely in open seas, it may fly out of the water and over the waves if it builds up enough speed."},{"version":"crystal","text":"It swims along freely, eating things that swim into its mouth. Its whole body is very coarse."},{"version":"ruby","text":"On sunny days, schools of MANTINE can be seen elegantly leaping over the sea’s waves. This POKéMON is not bothered by the REMORAID that hitches rides."},{"version":"emerald","text":"On sunny days, schools of MANTINE can be seen elegantly leaping over the waves. It is not bothered by the REMORAID that hitches rides."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"As it majestically swims, it doesn’t care if REMORAID attach to it to scavenge for its leftovers."},{"version":"diamond","text":"When the waves are calm, one may encounter a swarm of MANTINE swimming as if they are in flight."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It swims elegantly, mindless of REMORAID hitching on to its broad fins. It has a docile nature."},{"version":"platinum","tex